# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-fb245265eb84353ace92abac6a4d01c81883066e "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

According to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-3ed38ee6e3d095d6dc961f24303cfcc51e91114a "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
